{"problem_id": "fe617bc2-5a46-4c0e-b3fb-bd5a83d4fa01", "transformations": {"schema_version": 3, "revision": 2, "items": [{"at": "2026-08-27T10:29:35.515913+00:00", "by": {"type": "pipeline", "stage": "assets"}, "value": {"alt": "", "url": "/assets/90007bb7-5f6a-4960-ab47-6d19bd0e3670", "html": "<img alt=\"\" data-asset-id=\"90007bb7-5f6a-4960-ab47-6d19bd0e3670\" data-asset-key=\"image_1\" data-transformation-target-id=\"asset:image_1\" src=\"/assets/90007bb7-5f6a-4960-ab47-6d19bd0e3670\"/>", "kind": "ordinary_image", "asset_id": "90007bb7-5f6a-4960-ab47-6d19bd0e3670", "position": 0, "asset_key": "image_1", "parent_target_id": "section:condition:1"}, "operation": "rewrite", "transformation_target_id": "asset:image_1"}, {"at": "2026-08-27T10:29:35.515913+00:00", "by": {"type": "pipeline", "stage": "assets"}, "value": {"alt": "", "url": "/assets/d2c41717-5609-4c9d-ae14-c978050c0481", "html": "<img alt=\"\" data-asset-id=\"d2c41717-5609-4c9d-ae14-c978050c0481\" data-asset-key=\"image_2\" data-transformation-target-id=\"asset:image_2\" src=\"/assets/d2c41717-5609-4c9d-ae14-c978050c0481\"/>", "kind": "ordinary_image", "asset_id": "d2c41717-5609-4c9d-ae14-c978050c0481", "position": 0, "asset_key": "image_2", "parent_target_id": "section:solution:1"}, "operation": "rewrite", "transformation_target_id": "asset:image_2"}]}, "normalized_content": {"assets": [{"alt": "", "url": "/assets/90007bb7-5f6a-4960-ab47-6d19bd0e3670", "kind": "ordinary_image", "asset_id": "90007bb7-5f6a-4960-ab47-6d19bd0e3670", "asset_key": "image_1", "transformation_target_id": "asset:image_1"}, {"alt": "", "url": "/assets/d2c41717-5609-4c9d-ae14-c978050c0481", "kind": "ordinary_image", "asset_id": "d2c41717-5609-4c9d-ae14-c978050c0481", "asset_key": "image_2", "transformation_target_id": "asset:image_2"}], "format": "teacherhelper-normalized", "sections": [{"key": "condition", "html": "<p><img alt=\"\" data-asset-id=\"90007bb7-5f6a-4960-ab47-6d19bd0e3670\" data-asset-key=\"image_1\" data-transformation-target-id=\"asset:image_1\" src=\"/assets/90007bb7-5f6a-4960-ab47-6d19bd0e3670\"/> На ри­сун­ке изоб­ра­жен гра­фик про­из­вод­ной функ­ции <i>f</i>(<i>x</i>). Най­ди­те абс­цис­су точки, в ко­то­рой ка­са­тель­ная к гра­фи­ку  <i>y</i>  =  <i>f</i>(<i>x</i>) па­рал­лель­на пря­мой <i>y</i>  =  6<i>x</i> или сов­па­да­ет с ней.</p>", "title": "Условие", "asset_keys": ["image_1"], "section_id": "condition:1", "transformation_target_id": "section:condition:1"}, {"key": "answer", "html": "<p><span data-effect=\"spaced\">5</span></p>", "title": "Ответ", "asset_keys": [], "section_id": "answer:1", "transformation_target_id": "section:answer:1"}, {"key": "solution", "html": "<p><img alt=\"\" data-asset-id=\"d2c41717-5609-4c9d-ae14-c978050c0481\" data-asset-key=\"image_2\" data-transformation-target-id=\"asset:image_2\" src=\"/assets/d2c41717-5609-4c9d-ae14-c978050c0481\"/></p><p>По­сколь­ку ка­са­тель­ная па­рал­лель­на пря­мой <i>y</i>  =  6<i>x</i> или сов­па­да­ет с ней, она имеет уг­ло­вой ко­эф­фи­ци­ент, <nobr>рав­ный 6.</nobr> Зна­че­ние про­из­вод­ной в точке ка­са­ния равно уг­ло­во­му ко­эф­фи­ци­ен­ту ка­са­тель­ной. Оста­лось найти, в какой точке <i>x</i> про­из­вод­ная при­ни­ма­ет зна­че­ние 6: ис­ко­мая точка <i>x</i>  =  5.</p>", "title": "Решение", "asset_keys": ["image_2"], "section_id": "solution:1", "transformation_target_id": "section:solution:1"}], "schema_version": 3, "problem_reference_ids": {"prototype_problem_id": null, "group_parent_problem_id": null, "adjacent_group_parent_problem_id": null}}}